  "description": "Connects the OASIS to ActivityPub -- the W3C-standard federated social protocol powering the Fediverse (Mastodon, Lemmy, Pixelfed, and more). Publishes OASIS avatar activities, holon updates, and karma events as ActivityPub objects, enabling OASIS data to flow across the open social web. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
